{"id": "8bfc2cd5e4a8a828", "field": "text", "ja": "First Aidは貴重な技能じゃ。ここのトレーナー、Nissa Firestoneがやり方を教えてくれるぞ。The Great Forgeの南側、Ironforge Physicianで彼女を探すといい。", "status": "trusted", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5", "source": "draft-gossip-sg3@2026-09-15", "imported": "2026-09-15"}, "english": {"hash": "8bfc2cd5e4a8a828", "src": "gossip-key@normalize_v1"}, "reasons": [], "conflicts": []}
